title: "Beyond Prediction Accuracy: Reliability and Explainability of Machine Learning Models for Crop Yield Forecasting Under Temporal and Geographic Shifts"
abstract: "Codebase, empirical dataset, and experimental pipeline evaluating machine learning failure modes under secular trend drift in agricultural yield forecasting, conformal uncertainty quantification (Split Conformal, Time-Decayed Weighted Conformal Prediction, Adaptive Conformal Inference), and TreeSHAP attribution stability across sequential years."
